{
  "id": "ep001",
  "duration": 46.905,
  "beats": [
    {
      "start": 0.15,
      "end": 5.041,
      "text": "An oxygen tank exploded two hundred thousand miles from Earth, all because",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Apollo 13 Saturn V launch.jpg",
        "credit": "NASA",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Apollo_13_Saturn_V_launch.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 5.033,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 5.041,
      "end": 12.761,
      "text": "Apollo thirteen launched on April eleventh, 1970, commanded by Jim Lovell, with Fred Haise and Jack Swigert.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Fred Haise (left), Jack Swigert, and Jim Lovell pose on the day before launch.jpg",
        "credit": "NASA",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Fred_Haise_(left),_Jack_Swigert,_and_Jim_Lovell_pose_on_the_day_before_launch.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 5.033,
          "end": 9.433,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        },
        {
          "start": 9.433,
          "end": 12.767,
          "kind": "detail",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 12.761,
      "end": 18.381,
      "text": "Fifty-six hours into the mission, a routine oxygen tank stir triggered an explosion.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "2010-06-11 CSM&LM.jpg",
        "credit": "NASA",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:2010-06-11_CSM%26LM.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 12.767,
          "end": 15.0,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        },
        {
          "start": 15.0,
          "end": 18.367,
          "kind": "detail",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 18.381,
      "end": 22.506,
      "text": "Jack Swigert reported the emergency to ground control.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "designed card"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 18.367,
          "end": 22.5,
          "kind": "designed",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 22.506,
      "end": 27.151,
      "text": "The blast crippled power and vented all oxygen from the service module.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Apollo 13 SM.jpg",
        "credit": "NASA Astronaut (either James A. Lovell, John L. Swigert, or Fred W. Haise)",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Apollo_13_SM.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 22.5,
          "end": 24.467,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        },
        {
          "start": 24.467,
          "end": 27.167,
          "kind": "detail",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 27.151,
      "end": 32.071,
      "text": "The crew scrambled into the tiny lunar module, using it as a lifeboat.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Apollo 13 Lunar Module after separation from CSM (AS13-59-8562).jpg",
        "credit": "NASA",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Apollo_13_Lunar_Module_after_separation_from_CSM_(AS13-59-8562).jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 27.167,
          "end": 29.033,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        },
        {
          "start": 29.033,
          "end": 32.067,
          "kind": "detail",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 32.071,
      "end": 39.596,
      "text": "Engineers and astronauts created a duct-tape adapter called the mailbox to scrub lethal carbon dioxide.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Interior view of \"mail box\" for purging carbon dioxide from Lunar Module (as13-62-8929).jpg",
        "credit": "NASA Johnson Space Center",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Interior_view_of_%22mail_box%22_for_purging_carbon_dioxide_from_Lunar_Module_(as13-62-8929).jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 32.067,
          "end": 34.8,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        },
        {
          "start": 34.8,
          "end": 39.6,
          "kind": "detail",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 39.596,
      "end": 46.555,
      "text": "They looped around the Moon and splashed down safely in the Pacific Ocean on April seventeenth, 1970,",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Apollo 13 Saturn V launch.jpg",
        "credit": "NASA",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Apollo_13_Saturn_V_launch.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 39.6,
          "end": 46.9,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
